      "content": "i get that, and i've already talked to maintenance but they just said everything looked fine on their end. it's just that the timing is so specific... it's hard to believe it's just a coincidence every single time i'm having a breakdown or feeling really angry. it feels much more... internal. like my body is reacting to my mind in a way that actually affects the physical space around me. is there really no way that emotional energy could manifest like that?",
